g"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">电影</span><span></span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34448.html" title="纽约最后的扒手">纽约最后的扒手</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%BA%A6%E7%BF%B0%C2%B7%E7%89%B9%E6%89%98%E7%BD%97.html" target="_blank">约翰·特托罗</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%89%E5%AE%89%E5%8D%A1%E7%BD%97%C2%B7%E5%9F%83%E6%96%AF%E6%B3%A2%E8%A5%BF%E6%89%98.html" target="_blank">吉安卡罗·埃斯波西托</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%9F%A6%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E6%99%AE%E8%8E%B1%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">韦尔·普莱斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%A1%94%E6%8F%90%E9%98%BF%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E7%8E%9B%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E5%B0%BC.html" target="_blank">塔提阿娜·玛斯拉尼</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%BB%B4%E5%A4%9A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%C2%B7%E8%8E%AB%E6%B4%9B%E5%8B%92%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">维多利亚·莫洛勒斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%B2%E8%92%82%E5%A4%AB%C2%B7%E5%B8%83%E8%A5%BF%E5%AF%86.html" target="_blank">史蒂夫·布西密</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Delaney+Grace+Coyle.html" target="_blank">Delaney Grace Coyle</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%BD%97%E4%BC%AF%C2%B7%E5%B8%83%E6%9C%97.html" target="_blank">罗伯·布朗</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%B0%E7%B1%B3%C2%B7%E6%9D%8E%C2%B7%E6%9F%AF%E8%92%82%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">杰米·李·柯蒂斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8D%A1%E8%8E%89%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E9%98%BF%E7%BD%97%E4%BA%9A%E7%BB%B4.html" target="_blank">卡莉娜·阿罗亚维</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Echaka+Agba.html" target="_blank">Echaka Agba</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BC%8A%E6%A3%AE%C2%B7%E8%B5%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%B4%B9%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7.html" target="_blank">伊森·赫申费尔德</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%B0%E5%85%8B%C2%