34456.html" title="飞行嘉宾">飞行嘉宾</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E7%BB%B4%E5%98%89.html" target="_blank">李维嘉</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">李维嘉作为迎来送往的温暖主理人，在机场设下一间旅途中转站，迎接每一位恰好在此短暂停靠的“飞行好友”。在这里，大家一起开箱旅行好物，复盘过往的飞行轨迹，也写下对未来的计划。敞开心扉，畅聊人生的奇遇与欢笑</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34456.html" class="module-item-title" title="飞行嘉宾">飞行嘉宾</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第8期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32974.html" title="伦敦合伙人" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/56448fb13eecfe67571619e16a2f9fea.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="伦敦合伙人"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32974.html" title="伦敦合伙人">伦敦合伙人</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《伦敦合伙人》是由湖南卫视、芒果TV、小芒联合出品的青春合伙人开店创业真人秀。此次，合伙人们将进一步深入更全面真实的经营生态，全力助推国货出海，打造汇聚中国品牌的特色门店，从巴黎到伦敦，从深度筹备到</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32974.html" class="module-item-title" title="伦敦合伙人">伦敦合伙人</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261027合伙人日记第12期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34455.html" title="哥哥来啦" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/0e87319c7bbff7c0fb9904f138570582.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="哥哥来啦"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34455.html" title="哥哥来啦">哥哥来啦</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《哥哥来啦》是《甜蜜的任务》为《披荆斩棘2026》哥哥们定制的专属特辑。轻运动破冰，下午茶交心，带你解锁哥哥们舞台之下的反差魅力与宝藏多面！</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34455.html" class="module-item-title" title="哥哥来啦">哥哥来啦</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第13期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34454.html" title="对味" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/ce90754c5667236900bb9e769f1337c7.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="对味"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34454.html" title="对味">对味</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9E%97%E6%99%93%E5%B3%B0.html" target="_blank">林晓峰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%A4%E5%BF%97%E8%BE%89.html" target="_blank">古志辉</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AE%89%E7%A7%8B%E9%87%91.html" target="_blank">安秋金</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《对味》是由美食家搭档艺人组成城市美食探访组合，深入广东的5个风味之城——广州、惠州、东莞、汕头、深圳。以美食为入口，通过对传统技艺、家庭经营、师徒传承的记录，寻找每座城市的味觉图谱。《对味》由味入道</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34454.html" class="module-item-title" title="对味">对味</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第6期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34394.html" title="现在就出发 第四季" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260906-1/63e2e482540151eda873e01fe1609318.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="现在就出发 第四季"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34394.html" title="现在就出发 第四季">现在就出发 第四季</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%B2%88%E8%85%BE.html" target="_blank">沈腾</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%99%BD%E6%95%AC%E4%BA%AD.html" target="_blank">白敬亭</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%87.html" target="_blank">王安宇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%B4%BE%E5%86%B0.html" target="_blank">贾冰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%A8%E8%BF%AA.html" target="_blank">杨迪</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%87%91%E9%9D%96.html" target="_blank">金靖</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%AD%E9%BA%92%E9%BA%9F.html" target="_blank">郭麒麟</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BB%84%E6%99%AF%E7%91%9C.html" target="_blank">黄景瑜</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%8C%83%E4%B8%9E%E4%B8%9E.html" target="_blank">范丞丞</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E6%A5%9A%E7%84%B6.html" target="_blank">王楚然</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">出发团再度开启全球快乐野游，抽象派旅居4.0</div><