dex.php/vod/detail/id/34396.html" class="module-item-title" title="爱的修学旅行 第二季">爱的修学旅行 第二季</a></div><div class="module-item-text">20261026</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32867.html" title="舞蹈新风暴" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/854748b11de4be0ab4ed4b24f76b94eb.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="舞蹈新风暴"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32867.html" title="舞蹈新风暴">舞蹈新风暴</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《舞蹈新风暴》延续《舞蹈风暴》第一、二季高品质、高尖端的创作基调，以系列化模式持续深耕舞蹈竞演赛道，聚焦不同性别舞者群体的独特价值。本季以男性舞者为切入点，后续将推出女性舞者系列，逐步构建完整多元的新</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32867.html" class="module-item-title" title="舞蹈新风暴">舞蹈新风暴</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261026</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34398.html" title="朋友别见外" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260927-1/f775417586abf62daf385061b11fd9e2.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="朋友别见外"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style vide