">综合</span><span></span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33038.html" title="相信我：假先知真面目">相信我：假先知真面目</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Tolga+Katas.html" target="_blank">Tolga Katas</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Christine+Marie.html" target="_blank">Christine Marie</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">在这部真实犯罪题材的纪录片中，邪教专家兼电影制作人潜入一个一夫多妻制教派，目的是揭露一名自称先知的男子并将其绳之以法。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33038.html" class="module-item-title" title="相信我：假先知真面目">相信我：假先知真面目</a></div><div class="module-item-text">完结</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33039.html" title="牧师妻之死" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=img.picbf.com/upload/vod/20260826-1/104f4c60a45a736cf7a699d565503e4b.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="牧师妻之死"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综合</span><span></span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33039.html" title="牧师妻之死">牧师妻之死</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">这部三集真实犯罪纪录剧集聚焦米卡・米勒的人生与离奇离世。米卡是南卡罗来纳州默特尔比奇教会牧师约翰‑保罗・米勒的妻子。剧集采用从未公开的影像素材，以及亲友首次公开发声的一手证词，围绕有关控制与精神操控的</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33039.html" class="module-item-title" title="牧师妻之死">牧师妻之死</a></div><div class="module-item-text">完结</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-it