电影</span><span></span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34448.html" title="纽约最后的扒手">纽约最后的扒手</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%BA%A6%E7%BF%B0%C2%B7%E7%89%B9%E6%89%98%E7%BD%97.html" target="_blank">约翰·特托罗</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%89%E5%AE%89%E5%8D%A1%E7%BD%97%C2%B7%E5%9F%83%E6%96%AF%E6%B3%A2%E8%A5%BF%E6%89%98.html" target="_blank">吉安卡罗·埃斯波西托</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%9F%A6%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E6%99%AE%E8%8E%B1%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">韦尔·普莱斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%A1%94%E6%8F%90%E9%98%BF%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E7%8E%9B%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E5%B0%BC.html" target="_blank">塔提阿娜·玛斯拉尼</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%BB%B4%E5%A4%9A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%C2%B7%E8%8E%AB%E6%B4%9B%E5%8B%92%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">维多利亚·莫洛勒斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%B2%E8%92%82%E5%A4%AB%C2%B7%E5%B8%83%E8%A5%BF%E5%AF%86.html" target="_blank">史蒂夫·布西密</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Delaney+Grace+Coyle.html" target="_blank">Delaney Grace Coyle</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%BD%97%E4%BC%AF%C2%B7%E5%B8%83%E6%9C%97.html" target="_blank">罗伯·布朗</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%B0%E7%B1%B3%C2%B7%E6%9D%8E%C2%B7%E6%9F%AF%E8%92%82%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">杰米·李·柯蒂斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8D%A1%E8%8E%89%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E9%98%BF%E7%BD%97%E4%BA%9A%E7%BB%B4.html" target="_blank">卡莉娜·阿罗亚维</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Echaka+Agba.html" target="_blank">Echaka Agba</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BC%8A%E6%A3%AE%C2%B7%E8%B5%AB%E7%94%B3%E8%B4%B9%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7.html" target="_blank">伊森·赫申费尔德</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%B0%E5%85%8B%C2%B7%E9%A9%AC%E5%B0%94%E8%B5%AB%E6%81%A9.html" target="_blank">杰克·马尔赫恩</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%AF%94%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E8%90%A8%E5%A5%87.html" target="_blank">比尔·萨奇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%8B%89%E6%96%90%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E5%B8%AD%E5%B0%94%E7%93%A6.html" target="_blank">拉斐尔·席尔瓦</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">哈利是个典型的纽约本地人，老派的街头混客，自上世纪80年代起就靠扒窃来的现金疏通关节、谋取生计。他手法老道，技艺不断精进，但时代正在抛弃哈利。现在是2025年，街头每日的“收获”是什么？是花里胡哨可追</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34448.html" class="module-item-title" title="纽约最后的扒手">纽约最后的扒手</a></div><div class="module-item-text">HD</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33745.html" title="大唐妖探" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=2&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg3.doubanio.com%2Fview%2Fphoto%2Fs_ratio_poster%2Fpublic%2Fp2934719657.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="大唐妖探"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">电影</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33745.html" title="大唐妖探">大唐妖探</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%9B%B7%E6%B7%9E%E7%84%B6.html" target="_blank">雷淞然</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E5%91%88.html" target="_blank">张呈</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%94%A1%E6%B5%B7%E5%A9%B7.html" target="_blank">蔡海婷</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E5%96%86.html" target="_blank">张喆</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%87%AF.html" target="_blank">王凯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%8C%83%E5%93%B2%E7%90%9B.html" target="_blank">范哲琛</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">齿轮机关交织的大唐长安城，奇幻绚丽，飞檐翘角之下，人和妖比邻而居。梦想成为“长安第一神探”的天才少年狄少，破案功力一流，毒舌属性更甚；初出茅庐的狼妖捕快阿萨，武力不凡却心地纯良。一桩离奇命案，让这对冤</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33745.html" class="module-item-title" title="大唐妖探">大唐妖探</a></div><div class="module-item-text">4K</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33743.html" title="仙逆剧场版 弑仙之战" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261001-1/768ddcce374e30eae1cc04bbf4d52e60.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="仙逆剧场版 弑仙之战"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">电影</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33743.html" title="仙逆剧场版 弑仙之战">仙逆剧场版 弑仙之战</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%B2%E6%B3%BD%E9%B2%B2.html" target="_blank">史泽鲲</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">王林于雷之仙界遭遇宿敌绝命追杀，在生死绝境中展开一场惊天逆袭，以弱胜强，终成弑仙壮举。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33743.html" class="module-item-title" title="仙逆剧场版 弑仙之战">仙逆剧场版 弑仙之战</a></div><div class="module-item-text">4K</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33200.html" title="末世行者" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260830-1/ee836c32255d704406507d8c3fe7c452.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="末世行者"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">电影</span><span>美国</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33200.html" title="末世行者">末世行者</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%9B%85%E5%90%84%E5%B8%83%C2%B7%E8%89%BE%E6%B4%9B%E8%92%82.html" target="_blank">雅各布·艾洛蒂</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%9B%E6%A0%BC%E4%B8%BD%E7%89%B9%C2%B7%E5%BA%93%E9%87%8C.html" target="_blank">玛格丽特·库里</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">一场大流感之后，希格认识的所有人都死了，他的妻子、亲人、朋友，还有这个世界上99.9%的人，全都死了。他与他的狗孤独地居住在一座废弃的飞机场的机棚中，唯一的邻居是一个热爱枪支的反人类者。飞机上的无线电</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33200.html" class="module-item-title" title="末世行者">末世行者</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至高清</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/10092.html" title="控制狂" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=tupian.ffeiimg.com/upload/vod/20250313-1/15d6c4d09d0e30a5194ac48bf3100877.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="控制狂"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2025</span><span class="video-class">电影</span><span>美国</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/10092.html" title="控制狂">控制狂</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%87%AF%E8%8E%89%C2%B7%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD%C2%B7%E9%99%88.html" target="_blank">凯莉·玛丽·陈</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%BF%88%E5%B0%94%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E7%BD%97%E5%AE%BE%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">迈尔斯·罗宾斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%BF%98%E5%BE%81.html" target=