ef="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%9F%BA%E5%B0%94%C2%B7%E5%8F%B2%E5%AF%86%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E6%8B%9C%E8%AF%BA.html" target="_blank">基尔·史密斯·拜诺</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%A4%E6%96%AF%E5%A1%94%E5%A4%AB%C2%B7%E6%9E%97%E5%BE%B7.html" target="_blank">古斯塔夫·林德</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%9B%E9%87%8C%C2%B7%E4%BC%91.html" target="_blank">玛里·休</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AC%C2%B7%E9%98%BF%E4%BB%80%E7%99%BB.html" target="_blank">本·阿什登</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Emily+Lloyd-Saini.html" target="_blank">Emily Lloyd-Saini</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AE%89%E5%BE%B7%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E5%A5%A5%E6%B4%9B%E5%A4%AB%C2%B7%E6%A0%BC%E4%BC%A6%E5%BE%B7%E4%BC%AF%E6%A0%BC.html" target="_blank">安德斯·奥洛夫·格伦德伯格</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%96%AF%E7%A7%91%E7%89%B9%C2%B7%E4%BA%9A%E5%8E%86%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%C2%B7%E6%9D%A8.html" target="_blank">斯科特·亚历山大·杨</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Daniel+Bellus.html" target="_blank">Daniel Bellus</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">海边小镇里有一个身上散发臭味的打渔女（奥利维娅·科尔曼 Olivia Colman 饰），饱受狭隘的邻居嘲讽，而她为自己找了个柳条做成的丈夫。这段离经叛道的爱情在保守的小镇里引起了怒火、嫉妒和轩然大波</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34444.html" class="module-item-title" title="柳条人">柳条人</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至TC</div></div></div></div></div><div class="module"><div class="module-heading"><h2 class="module-title"><i class="icon-cate-ds"></i>剧集</h2><a class="more" href="/index.php/vod/type/id/2.html" title="更多剧集">更多剧集<i class="icon-arrow-right-o"></i></a></div><div class="module-list module-lines-list"><div class="module-items"><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34426.html" title="属于我们的城市 第二季" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261025-1/d83f94eb2353ef24dfa334acddc5469f.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="属于我们的城市 第二季"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>欧美</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34426.html" title="属于我们的城市 第二季">属于我们的城市 第二季</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%A9%B9%E5%A7%86%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E5%B0%BC%E5%B0%94%E6%A3%AE-%E4%B9%94%E4%BC%8A%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">詹姆斯·尼尔森-乔伊斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%B8%8C%E5%B0%94%E8%8E%8E-%E8%8E%AB%E5%A6%AE%E5%8D%A1%C2%B7%E6%9D%B0%E5%85%8B%E9%80%8A.html" target="_blank">希尔莎-莫妮卡·杰克逊</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%B1%89%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E6%98%82%E6%96%AF%E6%B4%9B.html" target="_blank">汉娜·昂斯洛</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BA%9A%E5%BD%93%C2%B7%E9%98%BF%E5%B8%83.html" target="_blank">亚当·阿布</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8A%B3%E6%8B%89%C2%B7%E8%89%BE%E5%85%8B%E6%9B%BC.html" target="_blank">劳拉·艾克曼</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%82%96%E6%81%A9%C2%B7%E5%9F%83%E6%96%87%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">肖恩·埃文斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%B1%E8%8E%89%C2%B7%E6%A0%BC%E9%9B%B7%E5%8E%84%E5%A7%86.html" target="_blank">朱莉·格雷厄姆</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%87%AF%E6%96%87%C2%B7%E5%93%88%E7%BB%B4.html" target="_blank">凯文·哈维</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AE%89%E8%BF%AA%C2%B7%E8%A9%B9%E5%A7%86%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">安迪·詹姆斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%B0%E5%85%8B%C2%B7%E9%BA%A6%E5%85%8B%E9%A9%AC%E4%BC%A6.html" target="_blank">杰克·麦克马伦</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E7%93%A6%E7%BD%97%C2%B7%E8%8E%AB%E7%89%B9.html" target="_blank">阿尔瓦罗·莫特</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%BF%88%E5%85%8B%C2%B7%E8%AF%BA%E5%B8%83%E5%B0%94.html" target="_blank">迈克·诺布尔</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%92%82%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E8%B7%AF%E6%98%93%E4%B8%9D%C2%B7%E7%BD%97%E4%BC%AF%E8%8C%A8.html" target="_blank">蒂娜·路易丝·罗伯茨</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%B2%8D%E6%AF%94%C2%B7%E6%96%AF%E7%A7%91%E8%8F%B2%E5%B0%94%E5%BE%B7.html" target="_blank">鲍比·斯科菲尔德</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Noe+Chiroque.html" target="_blank">Noe Chiroque</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">&amp;amp;amp;quot;This is just the beginning&amp;amp;amp;quot; All Michael knows is crime, until he falls in love. N</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34426.html" class="module-item-title" title="属于我们的城市 第二季">属于我们的城市 第二季</a></div><div class="module-item-text">全8集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33524.html" title="一瓯春" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=2&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimg3.doubanio.com%2Fview%2Fphoto%2Fs_ratio_poster%2Fpublic%2Fp2935819627.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="一瓯春"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33524.html" title="一瓯春">一瓯春</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%AE%B8%E5%87%AF.html" target="_blank">许凯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%91%A8%E4%B9%9F.html" target="_blank">周也</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">“杀伐千面腹黑男”沈润与“人间清醒黑莲花”谢清圆互为刀刃交错，在理智与情感中携手复仇，于朝堂官场上搅弄风云，于高门大户里明争暗斗。最终他们走出暗流深渊，奔赴璀璨新生。该剧改编自尤四姐的同名小说。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33524.html" class="module-item-title" title="一瓯春">一瓯春</a></div><div class="module-item-text">全30集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33473.html" title="兰香如故" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260911-fix/b703343a2001056e9494694b892c51c8.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="兰香如故"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33473.html" title="兰香如故">兰香如故</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%B0%AD%E6%9D%BE%E9%9F%B5.html" target="_blank">谭松韵</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%88%98%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%89.html" target="_blank">刘学义</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E6%A2%A6.html" target="_blank">李梦</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%91%E5%90%88%E6%83%A0%E5%AD%90.html" target="_blank">郑合惠子</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%AD%E6%9F%AF%E5%AE%87.html" target="_blank">郭柯宇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%B4%E7%94%9C%E7%94%9C.html" target="_blank">吴甜甜</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%B6%E9%9D%92.html" target="_blank">叶青</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%92%B2%E8%90%84.html" target="_blank">蒲萄</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AE%8B%E8%8A%B3%E5%9B%AD.html" target="_blank">宋芳园</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E5%98%89%E9%91%AB.html" target="_blank">李嘉鑫</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%88%98%E4%BD%B3%E7%8E%BA.html" target="_blank">刘佳玺</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%89%9B%E9%AA%8F%E5%B3%B0.html" target="_blank">牛骏峰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%8B%8F%E5%8F%AF.html" target="_blank">苏可</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BE%AF%E9%95%BF%E8%8D%A3.html" target="_blank">侯长荣</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%99%88%E5%88%9B.html" target="_blank">陈创</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%94%E4%BB%A4%E7%BE%8E.html" target="_blank">孔令美</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%AD%8F%E5%AD%90%E6%98%95.html" target="_blank">魏子昕</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%B4%E6%99%93%E4%B8%9C.html" target="_blank">吴晓东</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%B8%A5%E6%99%93%E9%A2%91.html" target="_blank">严晓频</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%AB%A0%E7%94%B3.html" target="_blank">章申</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">该剧根据禾晏山小说《兰香缘》改编。大学士府长孙女沈嘉兰与吏部尚书林家的长孙林锦楼订下婚约，然而朝堂风云突变，祖父沈大学士被判谋逆之罪，沈家惨遭灭门。林家为了自保，与沈家退婚，另与御前新贵赵家结亲。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33473.html" class="module-item-title" title="兰香如故">兰香如故</a></div><div class="module-item-text">全47集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34201.html" title="妈妈发疯了" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/a9ad8a6dab1ea0231507c2575b7beaad.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="妈妈发疯了"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>韩国</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34201.html" title="妈妈发疯了">妈妈发疯了</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%91%E6%95%8F%E5%84%BF.html" target="_blank">郑敏儿</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%87%91%E4%BA%A8%E5%A5%8E.html" target="_blank">金亨奎</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%87%91%E5%A7%AC%E8%B4%9E.html" target="_blank">金姬贞</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%A7%9C%E4%BA%AC%E5%AE%AA.html" target="_blank">姜京宪</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">该剧讲述一生为家庭而活的妈妈，和一生只为自己而活的妈妈，以及两位妈妈如冤家般的子女纠缠在一起的家庭成长记。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34201.html" class="module-item-title" title="妈妈发疯了">妈妈发疯了</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第21集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34074.html" title="玉簟秋" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/7bcb5f10f996c43a8ae2396afd992a82.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="玉簟秋"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34074.html" title="玉簟秋">玉簟秋</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%B8%9E%E7%A3%8A.html" target="_blank">丞磊</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BE%90%E8%8B%A5%E6%99%97.html" target="_blank">徐若晗</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">该剧改编自灵希同名小说。20世纪20年代的乱世中，少帅虞昶轩与女学生叶平君因一场邂逅深陷爱恨漩涡，彻底改写二人的人生轨迹。纵然身份悬殊、前路艰险，二人仍毅然冲破一切阻隔，在战火与命运的洪流中坚定携手，</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34074.html" class="module-item-title" title="玉簟秋">玉簟秋</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第28集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34425.html" title="夺金战" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/454963f85736129bf7c87bf893a6cde4.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="夺金战"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34425.html" title="夺金战">夺金战</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E4%B9%83%E6%96%87.html" target="_blank">李乃文</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%9C%E9%9C%96.html" target="_blank">任东霖</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%88%98%E7%AD%B1%E7%AD%B1.html" target="_blank">刘筱筱</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%94%90%E6%9B%BE.html" target="_blank">唐曾</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">河南灵宝县里，共产党人赵汉亭为了完成上级交给的任务而带领着队伍与国民党营长秦武几次较量都险胜，秦武都开始佩服这个未曾谋面的对手。抗战爆发后，日本人占领灵宝县，决定开发金矿。赵汉亭为了团结一切抗日力量而</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34425.html" class="module-item-title" title="夺金战">夺金战</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第12集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34336.html" title="大笑夜生活" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261025-1/d11a94d5b251a778942fa1af01a301da.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="大笑夜生活"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34336.html" title="大笑夜生活">大笑夜生活</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%A8%84%E8%89%BA%E6%BD%87.html" target="_blank">娄艺潇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%88%90%E6%9E%9C.html" target="_blank">成果</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E5%87%AF%E9%A6%A8.html" target="_blank">李凯馨</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9E%97%E6%98%95%E5%AE%9C.html" target="_blank">林昕宜</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%8C%83%E8%96%87.html" target="_blank">范薇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%99%88%E5%8D%9A%E8%B1%AA.html" target="_blank">陈博豪</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E9%9B%86%E9%AA%8F.html" target="_blank">张集骏</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E4%BF%8A%E8%BE%89.html" target="_blank">王俊辉</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%88%98%E5%90%9B%E6%B4%8B.html" target="_blank">刘君洋</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%A4%8F%E6%B8%85.html" target="_blank">夏清</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%8D%9A%E6%96%87.html" target="_blank">王博文</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E9%9B%85%E7%90%AA.html" target="_blank">张雅琪</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%94%A1%E9%94%A6%E6%98%95.html" target="_blank">蔡锦昕</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%9F%A9%E6%97%AD.html" target="_blank">韩旭</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%AD%8F%E5%B0%8A.html" target="_blank">魏尊</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BA%94%E5%B2%B1%E8%87%BB.html" target="_blank">应岱臻</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《大笑夜生活》讲述了一家“全能”夜校里的爆笑治愈故事。主理人叶思思带着性格各异的教师团队，靠着“烦恼修改器”定制课程，应对学员们五花八门的奇葩需求，在一连串爆笑乌龙里，帮都市人解决生活烦恼，也找到直面</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34336.html" class="module-item-title" title="大笑夜生活">大笑夜生活</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第8集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34333.html" title="仿生迷踪" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261024-1/0ae6ca531a7207e52b081b0419f3ece0.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="仿生迷踪"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34333.html" title="仿生迷踪">仿生迷踪</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%B8%A5%E6%B5%A9%E7%BF%94.html" target="_blank">严浩翔</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%AC%A7%E9%98%B3%E5%A8%A3%E5%A8%A3.html" target="_blank">欧阳娣娣</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%8A%B2%E6%9D%BE.html" target="_blank">王劲松</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%98%89.html" target="_blank">王嘉</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%BE%B9%E7%A8%8B.html" target="_blank">边程</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%86%AF%E9%9F%B5%E4%B9%8B.html" target="_blank">冯韵之</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%91%E8%83%BD.html" target="_blank">向能</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%99%E6%AF%93%E8%88%92.html" target="_blank">孙毓舒</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%B1%AA%E6%94%BF%E8%A8%80.html" target="_blank">汪政言</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%99%86%E5%A5%95%E5%91%88.html" target="_blank">陆奕呈</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9B%BE%E6%B2%90%E5%8F%AF.html" target="_blank">曾沐可</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%91%A3%E7%89%A7%E6%B2%99.html" target="_blank">董牧沙</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">2035年，AI高材生宋扬被诬陷杀害女友母女，逃亡中与觉醒自我意识的仿生人艾达结盟。二人接连破解离奇案件，深挖Cedar集团的黑幕。最终真相揭开，宋扬洗清罪名，艾达为保护宋杨而牺牲，但人类与仿生人迎来</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34333.html" class="module-item-title" title="仿生迷踪">仿生迷踪</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第12集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34276.html" title="非常营救" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261021-1/47498346d20f66e8f89047231b7cad0f.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="非常营救"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2029</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34276.html" title="非常营救">非常营救</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">如果说《战狼2》中的冷锋是打不倒的孤胆英雄，那《莫语者》则是真实存在的守护者。 为了查明妻女身亡的幕后真相，拥有顶级警护能力的卫天放弃了身份，在事发地安提洛卡里斯创立了面向一带一路经济区企业和民众提供</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34276.html" class="module-item-title" title="非常营救">非常营救</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第18集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34275.html" title="予苍龙" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261022-1/ebdc9bce883620f7a91e224ef99eebdd.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="予苍龙"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34275.html" title="予苍龙">予苍龙</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E6%B1%B6%E7%BF%B0.html" target="_blank">李汶翰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%83%A1%E8%BF%9E%E9%A6%A8.html" target="_blank">胡连馨</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">将门之女岳望舒被献祭龙渊，意外解封龙君离止，二人从敌对到相知，以“压制离火”为交易结盟。她借龙君之力反击岳家与齐王阴谋，他因她学会人间情爱。最终，离止留驻人间，成就一段旷世之恋。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34275.html" class="module-item-title" title="予苍龙">予苍龙</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第14集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34203.html" title="她的局" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/2073514291750c438f88cba31eb21b01.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="她的局"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34203.html" title="她的局">她的局</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8A%A0%E5%A5%88%E9%82%A3.html" target="_blank">加奈那</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%91%A8%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%BA.html" target="_blank">周大为</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">余颂为替父讨回公道，以助理身份进入宋家。她用真诚打动宋澄，与司机阿靖结盟，一起搜集证据，将宋家罪行公之于众。但她未被仇恨吞噬，而是挣脱枷锁，领悟到真正的胜利是掌控自己的人生，最终活成向阳而生的自己。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34203.html" class="module-item-title" title="她的局">她的局</a></div><div class="module-item-text">全24集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34138.html" title="嫁金钗" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261016-1/9ecc22df1c742bf6dc5e5cf55bbc7b0f.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="嫁金钗"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34138.html" title="嫁金钗">嫁金钗</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%94%B0%E6%9B%A6%E8%96%87.html" target="_blank">田曦薇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%97%AB%E6%A1%89.html" target="_blank">闫桉</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%88%98%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%97.html" target="_blank">刘小北</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%BD%98%E7%8F%BA%E9%9B%85.html" target="_blank">潘珺雅</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BB%A3%E9%AB%98%E6%94%BF.html" target="_blank">代高政</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%B0%B9%E6%96%87%E8%90%B1.html" target="_blank">尹文萱</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%91%E5%A5%BD.html" target="_blank">郑好</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E4%B8%80%E8%88%9F.html" target="_blank">王一舟</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%AF%9B%E6%9E%97%E6%9E%97.html" target="_blank">毛林林</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%B4%94%E5%A5%95.html" target="_blank">崔奕</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%99%88%E6%80%9D%E6%96%AF.html" target="_blank">陈思斯</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%99%88%E7%B4%AB%E5%87%BD.html" target="_blank">陈紫函</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%88%B4%E6%98%A5%E8%8D%A3.html" target="_blank">戴春荣</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%88%B4%E5%A8%87%E5%80%A9.html" target="_blank">戴娇倩</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%92%8B%E6%81%BA.html" target="_blank">蒋恺</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%94%E7%90%B3.html" target="_blank">孔琳</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%81%AC%E5%A6%9E.html" target="_blank">恬妞</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%A5%A0.html" target="_blank">王一楠</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%A8%E9%9D%92.html" target="_blank">杨青</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9B%BE%E4%B8%80%E8%90%B1.html" target="_blank">曾一萱</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">阿丑原是街上倒夜香的低贱少女，人人皆可践踏欺凌，只因一张酷似侯府千金魏娆的面容，意外成为国公府世子陆濯的冲喜新娘。阿丑野心勃勃，一心借机上位，然而濒死的新婚丈夫忽然苏醒，鸠占鹊巢引来连绵灾祸。魏娆（君</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34138.html" class="module-item-title" title="嫁金钗">嫁金钗</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第12集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/31624.html" title="家庭关系证明书" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/aa1e09a493588f0bc43533399a896f5c.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="家庭关系证明书"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>韩国</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/31624.html" title="家庭关系证明书">家庭关系证明书</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%B4%E4%B8%96%E8%8D%A3.html" target="_blank">朴世荣</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%9F%A9%E9%AB%98%E6%81%A9.html" target="_blank">韩高恩</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9E%97%E5%BF%97%E6%81%A9.html" target="_blank">林志恩</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%88%90%E4%BC%8A%E8%A8%80.html" target="_blank">成伊言</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">本剧讲述的是从出生瞬间开始就被打上家庭崩溃烙印的一个孩子和面对冷酷的偏见和命运，重新找回自己人生的女性故事。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/31624.html" class="module-item-title" title="家庭关系证明书">家庭关系证明书</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第67集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34262.html" title="与狼共眠" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/f921262f703431d377b919265c9bdaec.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="与狼共眠"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34262.html" title="与狼共眠">与狼共眠</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E8%89%BA%E5%BD%A4.html" target="_blank">李艺彤</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E9%9B%86%E9%AA%8F.html" target="_blank">张集骏</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%AD%E6%B5%A9%E7%84%B6.html" target="_blank">郭浩然</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">聚焦新时代青年成长与法治正义，讲述犯罪心理学专家顾言与伙伴沈聿坚守初心正义，携手侦破疑案、探寻真相的故事。以悬疑博弈融合人性思辨，聚焦人性底线、自我保护等现实议题，紧扣时代脉搏，叙事手法新，节奏紧凑。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34262.html" class="module-item-title" title="与狼共眠">与狼共眠</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第16集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34335.html" title="尚公主" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261023-1/eb03e735b40bf4354201a455f1521620.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="尚公主"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34335.html" title="尚公主">尚公主</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%9F%E5%AD%90%E4%B9%89.html" target="_blank">孟子义</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E6%98%80%E9%94%90.html" target="_blank">李昀锐</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%B4%E6%B1%89%E5%9D%A4.html" target="_blank">吴汉坤</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%85%A8%E4%BC%8A%E4%BC%A6.html" target="_blank">全伊伦</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E5%AD%9D%E8%B0%A6.html" target="_blank">李孝谦</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%B2%88%E4%BD%B3%E9%92%B0.html" target="_blank">沈佳钰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BD%99%E7%9A%91%E7%A3%8A.html" target="_blank">余皑磊</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%83%A1%E6%9D%8F%E5%84%BF.html" target="_blank">胡杏儿</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%94%90%E6%99%93%E5%A4%A9.html" target="_blank">唐晓天</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BE%90%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%94.html" target="_blank">徐海乔</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%99%8F%E7%B4%AB%E4%B8%9C.html" target="_blank">晏紫东</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%99%BD%E5%86%B0%E5%8F%AF.html" target="_blank">白冰可</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%B4%E5%BD%BC.html" target="_blank">吴彼</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E6%9C%88.html" target="_blank">张月</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%AD%90%E7%9D%BF.html" target="_blank">王子睿</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E5%98%89%E9%91%AB.html" target="_blank">李嘉鑫</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%88%98%E9%92%A7.html" target="_blank">刘钧</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%85%AC%E7%A3%8A.html" target="_blank">公磊</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BB%84%E5%9C%A3%E6%B1%A0.html" target="_blank">黄圣池</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%B2%99%E5%AE%9D%E4%BA%AE.html" target="_blank">沙宝亮</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">不甘命运的天家嫡女暮晚摇与智谋无双的寒门才俊言尚在岭南相逢、于盛安入局，携手步步破局，共筑清平天下的故事。一群少年各怀心事、各有所求，在乱世惊涛中搅动风云，奔赴理想。该剧改编自伊人睽睽的同名小说。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34335.html" class="module-item-title" title="尚公主">尚公主</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第12集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34430.html" title="西游记1996" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/ff2b3bdc12322a599dd08c10a3612b95.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="西游记1996"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>1996</span><span class="video-class">剧集</span><span>中国香港</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34430.html" title="西游记1996">西游记1996</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%B1%9F%E5%8D%8E.html" target="_blank">江华</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E5%8D%AB%E5%81%A5.html" target="_blank">张卫健</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BB%8E%E8%80%80%E7%A5%A5.html" target="_blank">黎耀祥</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BA%A6%E9%95%BF%E9%9D%92.html" target="_blank">麦长青</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">这是香港无线翻拍经典的又一力作。剧情除了根据经典名著《西游记》外，还加入了大量的搞笑元素，使得这一部作品在还原原著的同时，又创作出了有别于原著的另一番风味。东胜神州花果山的一块巨石爆出了一只明灵石猴（</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34430.html" class="module-item-title" title="西游记1996">西游记1996</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第30集完结</div></div></div></div></div><div class="module"><div class="module-heading"><h2 class="module-title"><i class="icon-cate-zy"></i>动漫</h2><a class="more" href="/index.php/vod/type/id/3.html" title="更多动漫">更多动漫<i class="icon-arrow-right-o"></i></a></div><div class="module-list module-lines-list"><div class="module-items"><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34458.html" title="成也萧河" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/04ffa9271faf54ddbfc41f5d9b02aa1b.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="成也萧河"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34458.html" title="成也萧河">成也萧河</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%B0%B7%E6%B1%9F%E5%B1%B1.html" target="_blank">谷江山</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BE%90%E4%BD%B3%E7%90%A6.html" target="_blank">徐佳琦</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%98%9F%E6%BD%AE.html" target="_blank">星潮</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%92%B1%E7%90%9B.html" target="_blank">钱琛</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">游戏中，全服第一剑士萧无尽和第一女通缉犯桃之夭夭不打不相识。现实中，冬川大学校园男神萧河和大一新生沈心因大学生电竞比赛相遇相知。二人和好友阳曜组成战队，一路过关斩将，力争要夺得比赛的冠军！萧河和沈心相</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34458.html" class="module-item-title" title="成也萧河">成也萧河</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第15集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3509.html" title="遮天" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/eabe8e1fe6add3ddf6d65b6df954b376.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="遮天"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2024</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3509.html" title="遮天">遮天</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%9B%B0.html" target="_blank">蛰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%A1%AB%E5%A4%A9.html" target="_blank">填天</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%B0%B9%E6%AD%A3.html" target="_blank">尹正</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%A5%9D%E7%BB%AA%E4%B8%B9.html" target="_blank">祝绪丹</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E6%A0%8E%E9%91%AB.html" target="_blank">王栎鑫</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E8%90%8C%E9%BB%8E.html" target="_blank">王萌黎</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%A2%81%E6%A3%AE.html" target="_blank">梁森</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%99%E5%98%89%E7%81%B5.html" target="_blank">孙嘉灵</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%B4%E8%B5%AB%E4%BC%A6.html" target="_blank">吴赫伦</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%94%E8%BF%9E%E9%A1%BA.html" target="_blank">孔连顺</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">由华策集团克顿传媒携中美影视业内顶级团队倾情打造，改编自辰东同名小说的影视剧#遮天#正在火热筹备中。 &amp;amp;amp;nbsp; &amp;amp;amp;nbsp; &amp;amp;amp;nbsp; &amp;amp;amp;nbsp; &amp;amp;amp;nbsp; &amp;amp;amp;nbsp; &amp;amp;amp;nbsp;</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3509.html" class="module-item-title" title="遮天">遮天</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第187集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34076.html" title="炼气十万年" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-21/d5cadd7d60f9e539cf8110fda3e4a1d1.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="炼气十万年"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2023</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34076.html" title="炼气十万年">炼气十万年</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">十万年前，天岚宗叱咤修真界，宗内弟子皆是天骄，所向披靡。唯独开山弟子徐阳一直是炼气期，为突破修为早日飞升，徐阳闭关万年。谁知出关时，修真界已经没落，天岚宗也只剩三五弟子，眼见就要灭宗，徐阳击退强敌</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34076.html" class="module-item-title" title="炼气十万年">炼气十万年</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第389集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/31941.html" title="万古神帝" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260721-1/f6d1c7ffe1763dd37f61baa06d37ebe8.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="万古神帝"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/31941.html" title="万古神帝">万古神帝</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%86%85%E8%AF%A6.html" target="_blank">内详</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《万古神帝》改编自阅文白金作家飞天鱼的同名小说。八百年前，张若尘身为明帝独子，天资绝世却遭青梅竹马的池瑶公主斩杀；八百年后，他重生在云武郡国的废柴九王子“张若尘”体内，这具身体体弱多病、毫无灵力，</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/31941.html" class="module-item-title" title="万古神帝">万古神帝</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第31集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3507.html" title="牧神记" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20241027-1/90eba13d5523ff395b96971c9cb5ad3c.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="牧神记"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2024</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3507.html" title="牧神记">牧神记</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E8%8B%A5%E7%91%9C.html" target="_blank">张若瑜</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E6%AC%A3.html" target="_blank">李欣</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%A8%8B%E7%8E%89%E7%8F%A0.html" target="_blank">程玉珠</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%9C%E6%99%B4%E6%99%B4.html" target="_blank">杜晴晴</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%99%9E%E6%99%93%E6%97%AD.html" target="_blank">虞晓旭</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BA%8E%E5%87%AF%E9%9A%86.html" target="_blank">于凯隆</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%AB%98%E5%97%A3%E8%88%AA.html" target="_blank">高嗣航</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E6%81%92.html" target="_blank">张恒</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%AE%87%E8%88%AA.html" target="_blank">王宇航</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%88%98%E5%AE%87%E8%BD%A9.html" target="_blank">刘宇轩</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%94%90%E6%98%8A.html" target="_blank">唐昊</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">秦牧天生凡体，历经考验成为天魔教教主，被延康国封为第一任太学博士。延康国叛乱之战中秦牧引来魔神，掀起浩荡风云，后随武可汗入楼兰黄金宫，一个人打遍圣宫无敌手。他返回延康,助国师平叛、造射日神炮，后得</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3507.html" class="module-item-title" title="牧神记">牧神记</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第106集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3627.html" title="吞噬星空" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/1e81d9ddb81fa08481c942a7f794300e.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="吞噬星空"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2020</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3627.html" title="吞噬星空">吞噬星空</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%A4%A7%E9%AD%94%E7%8E%8B.html" target="_blank">大魔王</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%9E%E5%90%83.html" target="_blank">吞吃</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%B5%B5%E4%B9%BE%E6%99%AF.html" target="_blank">赵乾景</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%B0%A2%E8%8E%B9.html" target="_blank">谢莹</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AE%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%BA%86.html" target="_blank">宋国庆</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BB%84%E8%BF%9B%E6%B3%BD.html" target="_blank">黄进泽</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E8%8B%A5%E7%91%9C.html" target="_blank">张若瑜</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">某一天，地球上出现了不明来由的RR病毒，将世界卷入灾难之中。受到感染的动物变异成为可怕的怪兽，大举入侵，人类面临毁灭之际筑起了围墙，成立基地市作为人类最后的堡垒。人类在这一段时间经历的磨难，被称为“大</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3627.html" class="module-item-title" title="吞噬星空">吞噬星空</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第247集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33881.html" title="熊出没之神奇宝物2" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261001-1/fc7e7ae5905ac8b12630f2c5a1c7700e.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="熊出没之神奇宝物2"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33881.html" title="熊出没之神奇宝物2">熊出没之神奇宝物2</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">金豪启动“许愿树”失败后并没有善罢甘休，暴躁升级的他发誓要卷土重来，并加大力度搜集神奇宝物。为达目的，金豪设计用神奇宝物“记忆葫芦”，抹去熊大熊二的记忆，并蛊惑他们视光头强为敌，指使他们前往光头强家搜</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33881.html" class="module-item-title" title="熊出没之神奇宝物2">熊出没之神奇宝物2</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第52集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32088.html" title="一斩苍穹" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/80edc839105c1689cdc84a8258d2edd3.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="一斩苍穹"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32088.html" title="一斩苍穹">一斩苍穹</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">从小努力，立志成为仙人，却不料先天缺乏灵根，无缘仙途，还被拐入诈骗园区，九死一生……转我50灵石，聆听我的复仇上位计划。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32088.html" class="module-item-title" title="一斩苍穹">一斩苍穹</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第15集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3796.html" title="无上神帝" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/upload/vod/20220325-1/fbd7fac919c3ebf703e8afbc12baa254.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="无上神帝"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2020</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3796.html" title="无上神帝">无上神帝</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%BA%AA%E6%9E%97.html" target="_blank">溪林</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%AD%E6%87%BF%E9%AA%A7.html" target="_blank">郭懿骧</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%85.html" target="_blank">关帅</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BB%84%E9%AA%A5.html" target="_blank">黄骥</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%A3%E9%AA%9C%E6%9D%B0.html" target="_blank">季骜杰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%92%9F%E5%B7%8D.html" target="_blank">钟巍</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%83%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%B5%81%E6%98%9F.html" target="_blank">烈之流星</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%98%AD%E9%9B%A8%E9%A6%A8.html" target="_blank">蘭雨馨</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E5%A6%AE.html" target="_blank">张妮</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BE%90%E7%BF%94.html" target="_blank">徐翔</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Akira%E6%98%8E.html" target="_blank">Akira明</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9F%B3%E7%9F%A5%E8%90%A7.html" target="_blank">柳知萧</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">万年之前，仙王牧云因持有诛仙图而遭人暗算，残魂沉睡万年之后，在天运大陆南云帝国有名的“废物牧云”身上觉醒。牧云初醒，就受到了学生妙仙语的刻意刁难，牧云轻松的就化解了妙仙语的陷阱，并举一反三的说出了更多</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3796.html" class="module-item-title" title="无上神帝">无上神帝</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第652集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3612.html" title="灵武大陆" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/8638ecfa25ce39663663e90138cd7963.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="灵武大陆"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2024</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3612.html" title="灵武大陆">灵武大陆</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E7%BF%B0%E6%9E%97.html" target="_blank">李翰林</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%92%B1%E7%90%9B.html" target="_blank">钱琛</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%80%9A%E6%A0%8F%E6%A1%A1.html" target="_blank">倚栏桡</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E6%81%A9%E6%B3%BD.html" target="_blank">张恩泽</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%B5%B5%E7%86%A0%E5%BD%A4.html" target="_blank">赵熠彤</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B5%A3.html" target="_blank">小浣</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%B8%A9%E6%BA%AA.html" target="_blank">温溪</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%94%A1%E5%A8%9C.html" target="_blank">蔡娜</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BD%90%E7%92%87.html" target="_blank">齐璇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E5%93%8E.html" target="_blank">李哎</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80.html" target="_blank">麻雀</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BB%84%E7%8E%AE.html" target="_blank">黄玮</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%98%BF%E7%A6%8F.html" target="_blank">阿福</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%A8%E6%98%95%E7%87%83.html" target="_blank">杨昕燃</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">灵武大陆，一个灵力和武魂并存的世界，灵修一念动山河，武者徒手撕天地。星辰镇昔日天才辰天，十岁后武魂沉寂、灵海枯竭，自此沦为家族废物，受尽他人冷眼。在一次生死搏斗中，辰天掉下悬崖，误入上古剑帝布置的大阵</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/3612.html" class="module-item-title" title="灵武大陆">灵武大陆</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第227集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34400.html" title="大王饶命3" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261003-1/405bd528b560dc9e1dc91616f8ed5791.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="大王饶命3"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34400.html" title="大王饶命3">大王饶命3</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">大魔王吕树从青州遗迹归来，进京述职，等待着他的是全新的境外冒险，与天罗地网组织一道，吕树先后前往泰国和日本开始全新修行之旅。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34400.html" class="module-item-title" title="大王饶命3">大王饶命3</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第6集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34399.html" title="乱马1/2 第三季" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261004-1/cff1cd4646f4b7a3e1e7d150e7531563.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="乱马1/2 第三季"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>日本</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34399.html" title="乱马1/2 第三季">乱马1/2 第三季</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%B1%B1%E5%8F%A3%E8%83%9C%E5%B9%B3.html" target="_blank">山口胜平</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9E%97%E5%8E%9F%E6%83%A0%E7%BE%8E.html" target="_blank">林原惠美</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%97%A5%E9%AB%98%E8%8C%83%E5%AD%90.html" target="_blank">日高范子</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%AB%98%E5%B1%B1%E5%8D%97.html" target="_blank">高山南</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BA%95%E4%B8%8A%E5%96%9C%E4%B9%85%E5%AD%90.html" target="_blank">井上喜久子</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%A4%A7%E5%A1%9A%E6%98%8E%E5%A4%AB.html" target="_blank">大塚明夫</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%95%BF%E5%B2%9B%E9%9B%84%E4%B8%80.html" target="_blank">长岛雄一</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%B1%B1%E5%AF%BA%E5%AE%8F%E4%B8%80.html" target="_blank">山寺宏一</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BD%90%E4%B9%85%E9%97%B4%E7%8E%B2.html" target="_blank">佐久间玲</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%85%B3%E4%BF%8A%E5%BD%A6.html" target="_blank">关俊彦</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%8D%E5%86%A2%E4%BD%B3%E7%BB%87.html" target="_blank">名冢佳织</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%89%E7%94%B0%E6%99%BA%E5%92%8C.html" target="_blank">杉田智和</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BD%90%E4%BB%93%E7%BB%AB%E9%9F%B3.html" target="_blank">佐仓绫音</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E4%BA%95%E4%B8%8A%E5%92%8C%E5%BD%A6.html" target="_blank">井上和彦</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%9C%9F%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%9A%E5%AD%90.html" target="_blank">真山亚子</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%A3%AE%E5%B7%9D%E6%99%BA%E4%B9%8B.html" target="_blank">森川智之</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AE%AB%E9%87%8E%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%88.html" target="_blank">宫野真守</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%82%A0%E6%9C%A8%E7%A2%A7.html" target="_blank">悠木碧</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%9F%B3%E7%94%B0%E5%BD%B0.html" target="_blank">石田彰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%87%8E%E6%B3%BD%E9%9B%85%E5%AD%90.html" target="_blank">野泽雅子</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">故事继续围绕早乙女乱马、天道茜以及响良牙等人展。良牙的新必杀技爆碎点穴预计将在本季正式登场，带来更多爆笑的格鬥与恋爱误会场面。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34399.html" class="module-item-title" title="乱马1/2 第三季">乱马1/2 第三季</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第4集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33166.html" title="灵境行者" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=img.picbf.com/upload/vod/20260903-1/bfee538e431a7871f987350120f51e50.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="灵境行者"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33166.html" title="灵境行者">灵境行者</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%86%85%E8%AF%A6.html" target="_blank">内详</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《灵境行者》是2023年起点头部同名小说改编动画，作者卖报小郎君。故事世界观设定鲜明，风格多变，灵境副本奇谲诡变。主角张元清，因一张神秘的黑卡成为夜游神，却身陷两大阵营正邪对抗的阴谋漩涡。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33166.html" class="module-item-title" title="灵境行者">灵境行者</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第9集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32771.html" title="财神窦占龙" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=img.picbf.com/upload/vod/20260816-1/c74627fc9828cb8f49c7dd3e7956833d.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="财神窦占龙"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32771.html" title="财神窦占龙">财神窦占龙</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%BE%B9%E6%B1%9F.html" target="_blank">边江</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E6%80%9D%E7%8E%8B%E4%B9%8B.html" target="_blank">张思王之</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%B5%B5%E6%A2%A6%E5%A8%87.html" target="_blank">赵梦娇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%9F%E5%AE%87.html" target="_blank">孟宇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E6%95%8F.html" target="_blank">李敏</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%87%8C%E6%8C%AF%E8%B5%AB.html" target="_blank">凌振赫</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">下霸唱继《鬼吹灯》后，打造最新成人向民俗暗黑传奇，在烟火人间与诡谲幻境之间重塑中式惊悚美学！崔老道为观天书，误放聚宝金蟾，金蟾贪恋人间繁华，转世为人，便是窦占龙。金蟾为躲天劫，在窦占龙灵窍内分扯三魂七</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32771.html" class="module-item-title" title="财神窦占龙">财神窦占龙</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第13集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32521.html" title="择日飞升" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/c7925978d6cc5eba6e587cd28c9feec1.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="择日飞升"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32521.html" title="择日飞升">择日飞升</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%88%E7%A0%82%E5%A4%AA.html" target="_blank">月砂太</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">乱世之下，妖祟横生，奸佞当道。又值幽界入侵，人、幽两界势力荼毒人间，捕蛇者许应因看不惯为幽界卖命的草头神欺压百姓，反抗犯下弑神之罪，又出手打死了不作为的朝廷官员，遭两界势力追杀，开启了逃亡的生涯···</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32521.html" class="module-item-title" title="择日飞升">择日飞升</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第17集</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/26459.html" title="光阴之外" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/d852e3658138a2e06e1105e30ebb3d49.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="光阴之外"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2025</span><span class="video-class">动漫</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/26459.html" title="光阴之外">光阴之外</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%85%89.%E9%98%B4.%E9%87%8C.%E5%A4%96.html" target="_blank">光.阴.里.外</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">天地是万物众生的客舍，光阴是古往今来的过客。苍天残面张开诡异之眼，所视之处生灵涂炭，化为永恒的禁区。末世之中，因果随行，死地后生。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/26459.html" class="module-item-title" title="光阴之外">光阴之外</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至第45集</div></div></div></div></div><div class="module"><div class="module-heading"><h2 class="module-title"><i class="icon-cate-dm"></i>短剧</h2><a class="more" href="/index.php/vod/type/id/5.htm