lass="module-title"><i class="icon-cate-zy"></i>综艺</h2><a class="more" href="/index.php/vod/type/id/4.html" title="更多综艺">更多综艺<i class="icon-arrow-right-o"></i></a></div><div class="module-list module-lines-list"><div class="module-items"><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34457.html" title="不想睡的星期五" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/813d38364c95c17d1b969aa2364959b4.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="不想睡的星期五"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34457.html" title="不想睡的星期五">不想睡的星期五</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%AD%E4%BA%AC%E9%A3%9E.html" target="_blank">郭京飞</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BB%84%E6%98%8E%E6%98%8A.html" target="_blank">黄明昊</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E5%B0%8F%E5%86%89.html" target="_blank">李小冉</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%99%E6%80%A1.html" target="_blank">孙怡</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%94%90%E8%89%BA%E6%98%95.html" target="_blank">唐艺昕</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%91%A8%E7%BF%8A%E7%84%B6.html" target="_blank">周翊然</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《不想睡的星期五》解锁不同城市夜生活玩法，打造最具城市灵魂的夜间大事件，每一夜都有新发现！全新定义新奇五夜生活，打造可复制的“最夯青年夜生活图鉴”。拒绝白天社会人面具，直击当代青年集体共鸣——夜晚不是</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34457.html" class="module-item-title" title="不想睡的星期五">不想睡的星期五</a></div><div class="module-item-text">超前营夜第17期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34456.html" title="飞行嘉宾" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/665c7fbb15456df28a7e8e1f33fc9954.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="飞行嘉宾"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34456.html" title="飞行嘉宾">飞行嘉宾</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E7%BB%B4%E5%98%89.html" target="_blank">李维嘉</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">李维嘉作为迎来送往的温暖主理人，在机场设下一间旅途中转站，迎接每一位恰好在此短暂停靠的“飞行好友”。在这里，大家一起开箱旅行好物，复盘过往的飞行轨迹，也写下对未来的计划。敞开心扉，畅聊人生的奇遇与欢笑</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34456.html" class="module-item-title" title="飞行嘉宾">飞行嘉宾</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第8期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32974.html" title="伦敦合伙人" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/56448fb13eecfe67571619e16a2f9fea.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="伦敦合伙人"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32974.html" title="伦敦合伙人">伦敦合伙人</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《伦敦合伙人》是由湖南卫视、芒果TV、小芒联合出品的青春合伙人开店创业真人秀。此次，合伙人们将进一步深入更全面真实的经营生态，全力助推国货出海，打造汇聚中国品牌的特色门店，从巴黎到伦敦，从深度筹备到</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32974.html" class="module-item-title" title="伦敦合伙人">伦敦合伙人</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261027合伙人日记第12期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34455.html" title="哥哥来啦" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/0e87319c7bbff7c0fb9904f138570582.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="哥哥来啦"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34455.html" title="哥哥来啦">哥哥来啦</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《哥哥来啦》是《甜蜜的任务》为《披荆斩棘2026》哥哥们定制的专属特辑。轻运动破冰，下午茶交心，带你解锁哥哥们舞台之下的反差魅力与宝藏多面！</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34455.html" class="module-item-title" title="哥哥来啦">哥哥来啦</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第13期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34454.html" title="对味" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://xl.xltupian.com/cover/ce90754c5667236900bb9e769f1337c7.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="对味"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34454.html" title="对味">对味</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9E%97%E6%99%93%E5%B3%B0.html" target="_blank">林晓峰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%A4%E5%BF%97%E8%BE%89.html" target="_blank">古志辉</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AE%89%E7%A7%8B%E9%87%91.html" target="_blank">安秋金</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《对味》是由美食家搭档艺人组成城市美食探访组合，深入广东的5个风味之城——广州、惠州、东莞、汕头、深圳。以美食为入口，通过对传统技艺、家庭经营、师徒传承的记录，寻找每座城市的味觉图谱。《对味》由味入道</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34454.html" class="module-item-title" title="对味">对味</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第6期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34394.html" title="现在就出发 第四季" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260906-1/63e2e482540151eda873e01fe1609318.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="现在就出发 第四季"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34394.html" title="现在就出发 第四季">现在就出发 第四季</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%B2%88%E8%85%BE.html" target="_blank">沈腾</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%99%BD%E6%95%AC%E4%BA%AD.html" target="_blank">白敬亭</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%AE%89%E5%AE%87.html" target="_blank">王安宇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%B4%BE%E5%86%B0.html" target="_blank">贾冰</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%A8%E8%BF%AA.html" target="_blank">杨迪</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%87%91%E9%9D%96.html" target="_blank">金靖</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%AD%E9%BA%92%E9%BA%9F.html" target="_blank">郭麒麟</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%BB%84%E6%99%AF%E7%91%9C.html" target="_blank">黄景瑜</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%8C%83%E4%B8%9E%E4%B8%9E.html" target="_blank">范丞丞</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E6%A5%9A%E7%84%B6.html" target="_blank">王楚然</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">出发团再度开启全球快乐野游，抽象派旅居4.0</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34394.html" class="module-item-title" title="现在就出发 第四季">现在就出发 第四季</a></div><div class="module-item-text">20261027</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34396.html" title="爱的修学旅行 第二季" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20261021-1/86388527f9f5f5edb1acd4b9d16c5767.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="爱的修学旅行 第二季"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34396.html" title="爱的修学旅行 第二季">爱的修学旅行 第二季</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E5%98%89%E6%A0%BC.html" target="_blank">李嘉格</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%91%A3%E4%B9%89%E6%9E%AB.html" target="_blank">董义枫</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%86%AF%E8%96%AA%E6%9C%B5.html" target="_blank">冯薪朵</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%92%9F%E6%AD%A3.html" target="_blank">钟正</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%AD%99%E6%99%93%E5%BD%A4.html" target="_blank">孙晓彤</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%AB%98%E6%A2%93%E6%B7%87.html" target="_blank">高梓淇</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%99%88%E7%91%9C.html" target="_blank">陈瑜</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9E%97%E5%AD%90%E6%BF%A0.html" target="_blank">林子濠</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《爱的修学旅行 第二季》是一档以“婚姻教育”与“亲密关系成长”为核心的亲密关系成长创新真人秀。节目邀请四组处于婚姻门槛前的情侣，在心理学专家的全程陪伴与专业指导下，通过一系列精心设计的“爱的练习”，系</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34396.html" class="module-item-title" title="爱的修学旅行 第二季">爱的修学旅行 第二季</a></div><div class="module-item-text">20261026</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32867.html" title="舞蹈新风暴" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/854748b11de4be0ab4ed4b24f76b94eb.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="舞蹈新风暴"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32867.html" title="舞蹈新风暴">舞蹈新风暴</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《舞蹈新风暴》延续《舞蹈风暴》第一、二季高品质、高尖端的创作基调，以系列化模式持续深耕舞蹈竞演赛道，聚焦不同性别舞者群体的独特价值。本季以男性舞者为切入点，后续将推出女性舞者系列，逐步构建完整多元的新</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32867.html" class="module-item-title" title="舞蹈新风暴">舞蹈新风暴</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261026</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34398.html" title="朋友别见外" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260927-1/f775417586abf62daf385061b11fd9e2.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="朋友别见外"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34398.html" title="朋友别见外">朋友别见外</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《朋友别见外》是由芒果TV出品的跨国文化交流纪实综艺，萧闱鸿、陶昕然、刘美含等参加，于2026年9月26日在东南卫视首播 [1]，并自9月27日起每周日12:00在芒果TV、21:42在海峡卫视播出</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34398.html" class="module-item-title" title="朋友别见外">朋友别见外</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261025第5期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34397.html" title="当家爸爸的聚会2" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260504-1/10a6b5b85016c94f7d5f341fcc6668bd.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="当家爸爸的聚会2"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/34397.html" title="当家爸爸的聚会2">当家爸爸的聚会2</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbs