.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="花儿与少年 第八季"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33307.html" title="花儿与少年 第八季">花儿与少年 第八季</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%90%B4%E5%90%9B%E5%A6%82.html" target="_blank">吴君如</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%AE%B7%E6%A1%83.html" target="_blank">殷桃</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9E%97%E4%BE%9D%E6%99%A8.html" target="_blank">林依晨</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%91%A8%E5%86%AC%E9%9B%A8.html" target="_blank">周冬雨</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%8F%AF.html" target="_blank">王可</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%82%93%E4%B8%BA.html" target="_blank">邓为</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E6%98%9F%E8%B6%8A.html" target="_blank">王星越</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《花儿与少年 2026》集结7位跨越代际的嘉宾，踏上地球彼端的一场自助游学之旅。从墨西哥启程，穿行秘鲁，直抵阿根廷，沿途与当地民众温暖交汇，在别具一格的“自主探索”中，实地触摸中墨考古文化交流的脉动，</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33307.html" class="module-item-title" title="花儿与少年 第八季">花儿与少年 第八季</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261025</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32552.html" title="披荆斩棘 第六季" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=img.picbf.com/upload/vod/20260809-1/e83f29c0eb4b2e5e025b00db3f7732d4.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="披荆斩棘 第六季"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span cl