href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%8E%8B%E5%95%B8%E5%9D%A4.html" target="_blank">王啸坤</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%99%88%E8%8B%A5%E8%BD%A9.html" target="_blank">陈若轩</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E7%B1%B3%E5%8D%A1.html" target="_blank">米卡</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E7%9D%BF.html" target="_blank">张睿</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%BC%A0%E5%8D%93%E5%B0%94.html" target="_blank">张卓尔</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%B6%E6%B6%A6%E6%B3%BD.html" target="_blank">叶润泽</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9B%BE%E8%BE%89.html" target="_blank">曾辉</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">全景沉浸式音乐竞演综艺再升级。新一季在延续经典的同时，将有全新的30位破局者，集结于此，他们来自不同疆域:荧幕传奇x舞台王者x跨界先锋x国际面孔……一场关于“男性力量”的重新定义，打破传统男性叙事框架</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32552.html" class="module-item-title" title="披荆斩棘 第六季">披荆斩棘 第六季</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261025</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32975.html" title="我家那闺女2026" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/26341e155670d44627317021c84245ac.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="我家那闺女2026"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32975.html" title="我家那闺女2026">我家那闺女2026</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《我家那闺女2026》是由一档以当代女性真实生活为核心的成长纪实真人秀，作为国民长青综艺IP，系列重启后凭借真实、温暖、治愈的内容底色收获全民好评。节目以多元女性人生生活为看点，集结各年龄段各圈层嘉宾</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32975.html" class="module-item-title" title="我家那闺女2026">我家那闺女2026</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261024</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32416.html" title="一路向海的少年" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/24f251cb9569d43975c1feebb0a61c02.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="一路向海的少年"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32416.html" title="一路向海的少年">一路向海的少年</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">《一路向海的少年》是一档聚焦新时代青年成长历练的公路纪实真人秀。节目以&amp;amp;quot;从离海最远的地方出发，一路向海&amp;amp;quot;为核心立意，讲述五位少年从亚欧大陆腹地的新疆启程，以自驾方式完成八站新疆公路之旅，最终奔赴心之向</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32416.html" class="module-item-title" title="一路向海的少年">一路向海的少年</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至20261023</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32877.html" title="大哥小助理" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=2&url=xl.xltupian.com/cover/9dac9db8204abfacece76632f697b6ec.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="大哥小助理"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综艺</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32877.html" title="大哥小助理">大哥小助理</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E8%83%A1%E5%86%9B.html" target="_blank">胡军</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9D%8E%E4%B9%83%E6%96%87.html" target="_blank">李乃文</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">两位50+娱乐圈前辈组成“经纪团” ，每期为一位具有代表性的年轻后辈艺人担任“一日经纪人”全面负责艺人一天的行程安排与服务，从接送机、行程对接、妆发准备到工作陪伴、突发危机处理。两位经纪人需动用自己的</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/32877.html" class="module-item-title" title="大哥小助理">大哥小助理</a></div><div class="module-item-text">20261023</div></div></div></div></div><div class="module"><div class="module-heading"><h2 class="module-title"><i class="icon-cate-dy"></i>综合</h2><a class="more" href="/index.php/vod/type/id/21.html" title="更多综合">更多综合<i class="icon-arrow-right-o"></i></a></div><div class="module-list module-lines-list"><div class="module-items"><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/29836.html" title="花样青春，限量版" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=1&url=xinlangtupian.com/cover/ab7f84ae8b7735472391a0d6ee0284fb.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="花样青春，限量版"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综合</span><span>韩国</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/29836.html" title="花样青春，限量版">花样青春，限量版</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%83%91%E8%A3%95%E7%BE%8E.html" target="_blank">郑裕美</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%B4%E5%8F%99%E4%BF%8A.html" target="_blank">朴叙俊</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%B4%94%E5%AE%87%E6%A4%8D.html" target="_blank">崔宇植</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">这个节目的妙趣在于突发旅行。突然告诉出演者去旅行的日程，出演者带着制作组原封不动地给的每人10万韩元经费，于2026年2月24日通过频道十五夜直播被绑架到旅行地。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/29836.html" class="module-item-title" title="花样青春，限量版">花样青春，限量版</a></div><div class="module-item-text">第9期</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33040.html" title="体坛秘史：文斯·扬的人生剖白" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=2&url=https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2935240360.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="体坛秘史：文斯·扬的人生剖白"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综合</span><span></span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33040.html" title="体坛秘史：文斯·扬的人生剖白">体坛秘史：文斯·扬的人生剖白</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%86%85%E8%AF%A6.html" target="_blank">内详</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">文斯・杨在玫瑰碗交出史上最伟大的赛场表现之一，作为德州长角队传奇，他被视作 NFL 的下一位超级巨星。可伤病、赛场内外冲突与突如其来的人生重创，勾勒出高光集锦背后远更为复杂曲折的人生故事。纪录片通过一</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33040.html" class="module-item-title" title="体坛秘史：文斯·扬的人生剖白">体坛秘史：文斯·扬的人生剖白</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至高清</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33041.html" title="哈士奇王朝：康涅狄格大学女篮" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=2&url=https://img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2935247361.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="哈士奇王朝：康涅狄格大学女篮"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综合</span><span>美国</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33041.html" title="哈士奇王朝：康涅狄格大学女篮">哈士奇王朝：康涅狄格大学女篮</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%86%85%E8%AF%A6.html" target="_blank">内详</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">走近美国大学篮球历史上最强势的赢得12座冠军的球队，而丽贝卡·洛博、黛安娜·陶拉西、佩奇·布克尔斯等揭秘她们如何战胜康涅狄格大学，打造传奇王朝。（華堅馮力士）</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33041.html" class="module-item-title" title="哈士奇王朝：康涅狄格大学女篮">哈士奇王朝：康涅狄格大学女篮</a></div><div class="module-item-text">完结</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33037.html" title="最后一课" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://wogg.xxooo.cf/db.php?url=https://img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2923358984.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="最后一课"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2025</span><span class="video-class">综合</span><span>中国大陆</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33037.html" title="最后一课">最后一课</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%86%85%E8%AF%A6.html" target="_blank">内详</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">A nuanced and deeply personal portrait of master educator Robert Reich, The Last Class follows him a</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33037.html" class="module-item-title" title="最后一课">最后一课</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至高清</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33038.html" title="相信我：假先知真面目" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=img.picbf.com/upload/vod/20260511-1/ccbcdfec8d114f9df3ac48d74d269029.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="相信我：假先知真面目"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综合</span><span></span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33038.html" title="相信我：假先知真面目">相信我：假先知真面目</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Tolga+Katas.html" target="_blank">Tolga Katas</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/Christine+Marie.html" target="_blank">Christine Marie</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">在这部真实犯罪题材的纪录片中，邪教专家兼电影制作人潜入一个一夫多妻制教派，目的是揭露一名自称先知的男子并将其绳之以法。</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33038.html" class="module-item-title" title="相信我：假先知真面目">相信我：假先知真面目</a></div><div class="module-item-text">完结</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33039.html" title="牧师妻之死" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://gimg0.baidu.com/gimg/app=2001&n=0&g=0n&fmt=jpeg&src=img.picbf.com/upload/vod/20260826-1/104f4c60a45a736cf7a699d565503e4b.webp" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="牧师妻之死"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综合</span><span></span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33039.html" title="牧师妻之死">牧师妻之死</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E6%9C%AA%E7%9F%A5.html" target="_blank">未知</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text">这部三集真实犯罪纪录剧集聚焦米卡・米勒的人生与离奇离世。米卡是南卡罗来纳州默特尔比奇教会牧师约翰‑保罗・米勒的妻子。剧集采用从未公开的影像素材，以及亲友首次公开发声的一手证词，围绕有关控制与精神操控的</div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/33039.html" class="module-item-title" title="牧师妻之死">牧师妻之死</a></div><div class="module-item-text">完结</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><div class="module-item-pic"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/30021.html" title="马丁·肖特：转瞬人生" ><i class="icon-play"></i></a><img class="lazy lazyloaded" data-src="https://woog.430520.xyz/t/?id=2&url=https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2932078993.jpg" src="https://ncstatic-file.clewm.net/rsrc/2025/0930/20/945a6372224243d3f3d63cb309c0b7b1.png" alt="马丁·肖特：转瞬人生"><div class="loading"></div></div><div class="module-item-caption"><span>2026</span><span class="video-class">综合</span><span>美国</span></div><div class="module-item-content"><div class="module-item-style video-name"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/30021.html" title="马丁·肖特：转瞬人生">马丁·肖特：转瞬人生</a></div><div class="module-item-style video-tag"><a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E9%A9%AC%E4%B8%81%C2%B7%E8%82%96%E7%89%B9.html" target="_blank">马丁·肖特</a>&nbsp;<a href="/index.php/vod/search/actor/%E5%8F%B2%E8%92%82%E5%A4%AB%C2%B7%E9%A9%AC%E4%B8%81.html" target="_blank">史蒂夫·马丁</a>&nbsp;</div><div class="module-item-style video-text"></div></div></div><div class="module-item-titlebox"><a href="/index.php/vod/detail/id/30021.html" class="module-item-title" title="马丁·肖特：转瞬人生">马丁·肖特：转瞬人生</a></div><div class="module-item-text">更新至高清</div></div><div class="module-item"><div class="module-item-cover"><di